# Fuzz baseline. Versionable evidence is only the scored output — baseline.json,
# baseline_report.md, results/*.json, status/*.build.json — plus the minimized
# reproducers (min-crash-*, min-leak-*). Seed corpora and the raw libFuzzer
# artifact dumps are regenerable by the harness and would otherwise push ~193 MB
# across ~47.8k files into history permanently.
/evaluation/results/fuzz_baseline/corpus/
# Prefix-anchored: "crash-*" does not match "min-crash-*", so the minimized
# reproducers stay tracked without needing negation rules.
/evaluation/results/fuzz_baseline/**/crash-*
/evaluation/results/fuzz_baseline/**/leak-*
/evaluation/results/fuzz_baseline/**/oom-*
/evaluation/results/fuzz_baseline/**/timeout-*
/evaluation/results/fuzz_baseline/**/slow-unit-*

